  "body_html": "<p>Elevate your bedroom with our exquisite custom Viking-themed quilt from Jeminise, where Norse mythology meets cozy comfort. Crafted from soft polyester and filled with high-quality silk floss, this quilt offers a perfect balance of warmth and breathability for year-round comfort. Beautifully printed with a detailed Raven and runic circle design, it makes a wonderful personalized gift or a striking addition to your guest bedroom.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Personalize your quilt by adding custom text, names of loved ones, or selecting from optional matching pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Viking Art Style:</strong> Features a high-confidence graphic illustration of a Norse Raven centered within a detailed runic circle with Celtic knotwork.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort &amp; Warmth:</strong> Designed with a breathable soft polyester outer layer and high-quality silk floss filling for luxurious softness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor and outdoor use, whether as a bed quilt, throw blanket, picnic mat, or for cozy backyard camping.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from 5 versatile sizes to fit your needs: Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, drying quickly to return to its fluffy, comfortable state.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Viking-04</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life, Viking</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Viking Decor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
